> This site offers authoritative insights on business consultancy for owner-run businesses in Devon and Cornwall, including strategic understanding, case studies, and client testimonials.

Arrington Consultancy provides tailored business advice for owner-managed companies, emphasizing understanding the business first, then identifying key areas for growth and efficiency. The site shares the founder’s extensive experience, real-world case studies, and practical methods to improve business resilience and owner sustainability.

## Core Content

- [What We Do](/what-we-do): Details on the consultancy approach, focusing on understanding the business before suggesting improvements.
- [What We Have Done](/what-we-have-done): Case studies of business turnarounds, margin improvements, and exits.
- [About Us](/about-us): Background of Tom Arrington, illustrating practical experience in business consultancy.
- [Useful Thinking](/useful-thinking): Ideas and perspectives to assist business owners in strategic decision-making.

## Service Offerings

- [30 Minute Conversation](/book-a-30-minute-conversation): Opportunity to initiate a business assessment or discussion.
- [Tell us what is going on](#conversation): Engagement prompt for business owners to share their challenges.
- [WhatsApp us](https://wa.me/441752477026?text=Hi%20Tom%2C%20I%20d like%20to%20speak%20to%20you%20about%20Arrington%20Consultancy): Direct contact link for inquiries.

## Primary Focus Areas

- Owner dependency reduction
- Business visibility improvement
- Building stronger, sustainable businesses

## Resources

- [Read what we have done](/what-we-have-done): In-depth examples of past client success stories demonstrating practical results.

## Optional

- [What Business Owners Say](/what-business-owners-say): Client testimonials highlighting the impact of consultancy services.

